# OFFICE ARENA: WEB GAME PLATFORM v6.0 (FULL DOCUMENT)
### Version 1 = the platform + ONE game (Tank Arena). More games are added later, one at a time, without changing the platform.
### Online rooms for 2 to 12 players: create a room, send the code, all your friends join. Works on PC (keyboard + mouse), phone and tablet (touch), gamepad, and installs as an app (PWA).
### This document REPLACES all earlier versions. Do not summarize it and do not drop any detail.

---

## WHAT CHANGED IN v6.0
1. **Online rooms hold 2 to 12 players** (humans + bots) and up to 20 spectators. Friends join by **code, link, QR or WhatsApp**. Open rooms list and Quick Join added (Sections 6, 8, 9, 11).
2. **Tank Arena supports teams up to 6v6 and Free For All up to 12**, with auto-scaling points, time and captures, spawn pools, name tags, a kill feed and a bigger scoreboard (Sections 12 to 14, 17).
3. **Lobby redesigned for up to 12 players** with waiting slots, ready rules, "Start anyway", late join, host transfer, kick and ban (Sections 8, 9).
4. **Networking rewritten for 12 players:** compact snapshots, server limits, load test (Sections 11, 22, 23, 24).
5. **Local Party stays at 2 to 4 players on one screen.** More players use an online room.
6. New edge cases P21 to P30 and T21 to T30, new docs (`ROOMS.md`), new QA rows.

