## 6. PLATFORM FEATURES (rooms, friends and more)

### 6.1 Feature table
| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| Profile (local) | Nickname (1 to 14 characters, no `<>`), color (12 swatches), icon (16 icons), saved in localStorage. Stats per game saved locally |
