### 7.5 UI rules
- Minimum text 16 px, minimum touch target 48 x 48 px, at least 8 px between targets.
- Contrast: text on surfaces at least 4.5:1. Team and player color is never the only signal (labels, icons and shape badges too).
- Every screen reachable and leavable by keyboard (Tab order, Enter, Esc, arrow keys), mouse and touch. No dead ends: every screen has Back or Home.
- Loading: skeleton cards, never a blank screen. Errors: a clear sentence plus one button to fix or go back.
- Confirm dialogs only for leaving a running match, kicking or banning a player, and "Start anyway".

