## 9. USER FLOWS (end to end)

**9.1 First visit:** Title (tap or key) -> Welcome card (nickname, color, icon; skippable, default "Player123") -> Control Setup (device detected, pick a style, try it) -> Hub with 3 coach marks -> Game Detail -> "Try Solo first?" offered once.

**9.2 Host: create a room and invite friends**
1. Hub -> Tank Arena -> **Create Room** -> set room name, visibility, max players, password -> Create.
2. The Lobby opens. The host sees the **invite panel**: room code (for example `KQTR`), link, QR, Share, WhatsApp.
3. The host sends the code or link to friends (WhatsApp group, Slack, Teams, or says it aloud).
4. Friends appear in the lobby live (row slides in, "joined" blip). Empty slots show "Waiting for a friend".
5. Players pick team and press **Ready**. The host picks mode, map and settings (or keeps defaults; Auto scaling fits points and time to the player count).
6. The host presses **Start (N/N ready)** (or Auto-start). Loading and Plan (5 s) -> countdown 3-2-1 -> match.
7. Results -> **Rematch** (votes) or Back to Lobby or Leave.

**9.3 Friend: join**
- **By link or QR:** open `?room=ABCD` -> the code is pre-filled -> (password if needed) -> Lobby -> pick team -> Ready.
- **By code:** Hub -> Join Room -> type the 4 letters (or Paste from clipboard) -> Join.
- **From Open rooms:** Hub -> Join Room -> Open rooms -> Join. Or press **Quick Join**.
- **If the room is full:** "Room is full (12/12). Watch as spectator?" -> spectate; when a seat frees, a **Take a seat** button appears (first tap wins).
- **If a match is running:** join as spectator; press **Join match** to enter at the next respawn (while late join is allowed).

**9.4 Late join:** spectator presses **Join match** -> placed in the smaller team (team modes) or a free FFA seat -> spawns at the next respawn with a "Joined late" tag and a 1.5 s shield. Not allowed in sudden death or after 70% of the time.

**9.5 Local Party:** Hub -> Game Detail -> Local Party -> players tap their corner to join (up to 4) -> choose mode, map, bots -> Start -> match -> Results -> Rematch.

**9.6 Solo:** Hub -> Game Detail -> Solo vs Bots -> mode, map, bots (1 to 11), difficulty -> Start -> match -> Results.

**9.7 Leaving and returning:** Leave match: confirm, then back to Game Detail. Host leaves: the earliest-joined human becomes host (toast); the host can also **Make host** to another player before leaving. Disconnect: seat held 60 s; rejoin from Recent rooms or the same link; the tank is parked and invulnerable meanwhile. Browser back goes to the previous screen; during a match it asks for confirmation. If the host **closes the room**, everyone sees "The host closed the room" and goes to the Hub.

**9.8 Install as an app:** after the second visit show an Install button (where the browser allows) and a Settings entry. On iPhone show the tip "Share, then Add to Home Screen".

**9.9 Add a new game later:** the developer follows Section 5.3. Players see the new card with a "New" ribbon.

