All effects are client-side and never change the simulation. Use object pools. Provide a Low quality version of each (fewer particles, no shake, no smoke).
| Event | Effect |
|---|---|
| Drive | tracks alternate frames, dust puffs behind (sand: tan, steel: none, grass: green specks), engine hum |
