| Recoil turn (Arcade) | hull rotates 30 degrees in 0.12 s with a small skid mark |
| Shell hits brick | brick cracks (first hit) or breaks (second): 4 flying pieces with spin and drag, dust puff, small crater decal that fades in 15 s |
| Shell hits steel or pit | spark burst and a short "ping" |
| Shell hits crate | wood splinters (4 pieces), maybe a power item pops out |
| Shell hits tank | white flash 0.08 s, hit spark, then destruction |
| Tank destroyed | white flash, orange burst (explosion sheet 8 frames, 24 fps), shockwave ring 0.3 s, 8 sparks, turret pops off and spins 0.8 s, hull becomes a charred wreck for 2 s with smoke, then fades (with 9 or more players wrecks last 1 s) |
| Respawn | tank appears in the spawn pool point with a light beam 0.4 s; where the map has bays, behind X barriers; the digit counts 3-2-1; the tank blinks (shield) for 1.5 s |
| Late join | "Joined late" tag above the tank for 3 s |
| Power box touched | box pops; on return scale 0 to 1.2 to 1; 12 sparkles; power icon pops above the tank |
| Speed, Shield, Unlimited | blue flame and speed lines; blue ring that pops with a burst; glowing barrel |
| Flag | flag waves (4 frames, 6 fps); carried flag floats above the tank with a faster wave; dropped flag blinks with a ring; capture: confetti burst and a "FLAG!" banner; return: sparkle |
| Round start and end | "3-2-1" pop, big "START!" outlined text, "WINNER" banner with curved text and confetti (150 pooled particles) |
| Kill feed line | slides in 200 ms, fades after 3 s |
| Aim ring (Mouse Steer) | small ring at the cursor with a thin line to the barrel |
Never flash the screen more than 3 times per second. Particle budget: High 300, Medium 150, Low 60 (auto-lower if FPS stays under 40 for 5 s, and automatically one level lower when 9 or more tanks are in the match).

